:: Start [nobar]
<<include "Banner">>
<div class="stamp">Case file 003</div>
<p class="meta">Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum · Boston · today</p>
<h1>Frame by Frame</h1>
<p>It's your first day as the museum's new security investigator. The director walks you into the Dutch Room and stops in front of an empty gold frame.</p>
<p class="quote chief">"Thirteen works, gone since 1990. People keep asking me two questions: who did it, and where is the art now? Go through the file. Tell me what we really know, and which lead is worth following. Seven leads."</p>
<<if $locker.includes("blueSilent")>><div class="card"><span class="card-label">From your evidence locker</span><span class="card-title">Your sensor log</span><span class="card-text">You found the motion-detector record in Part 1. The silent Blue Room is still in your notebook of puzzles.</span></div><</if>>
<div class="how">
<p><b>How to investigate</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Visiting a new place uses one lead. Going back is free.</li>
<li>Some clues are facts. Some are <b>claims</b> nobody could check. Some are just guesses.</li>
<li>Before your report, you'll sort theories about where the art is and review three real suspects. None was ever charged, so we don't print their names.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="actions">[[Open the file|Hub]]</div>


:: Hub
<<if $leads lte 0>><<goto "OutOfLeads">><</if>>
<h2>Where to?</h2>
<p class="meta">New places cost a lead. Places you've visited are free to revisit.</p>
<<casemap>>
<details class="maplist"><summary>Show the places as a list</summary>
<ul class="map">
<li><<maplink "Frames" "🖼️ The Dutch Room today">></li>
<li><<maplink "Reward" "💰 The reward office">></li>
<li><<maplink "Letter" "✉️ The 1994 letter">></li>
<li><<maplink "Warehouse" "🔦 The 1997 warehouse report">></li>
<li><<maplink "FBI" "🕵️ The FBI's statements">></li>
<li><<maplink "Connecticut" "🏚️ The Connecticut search file">></li>
<li><<maplink "Sketches" "✏️ The police sketches and witnesses">></li>
<li><<maplink "GuardFile" "📁 The night guard's file">></li>
<li><<maplink "Lawyers" "⚖️ The prosecutors' office">></li>
<li><<maplink "Newsroom" "📰 A radio call-in show">></li>
</ul>
</details>
<div class="actions secondary"><<link "Deduction board (free)">><<set $return to "Hub">><<goto "Board">><</link>>[[I'm ready to report|Theories]]</div>


:: OutOfLeads
<h2>Out of leads</h2>
<p class="quote chief">"That's the whole file," the director says. "What do we know?"</p>
<div class="actions"><<link "One last look at the deduction board">><<set $return to "OutOfLeads">><<goto "Board">><</link>>[[Make your report|Theories]]</div>


