:: Theories [nobar]
<div class="stamp">Theory board</div>
<h2>Where is the art now?</h2>
<p>Five theories. For each one, can your evidence <b>rule it out</b>, or is it <b>still possible</b>?</p>
<div id="thlist"><<include "TheoryList">></div>
<div id="thgo"><<include "TheoryGo">></div>


:: TheoryList
<<for _t range setup.theories>><<capture _t>>
<div class="sortrow"><p class="card-title"><<print _t.text>></p>
<div class="choices two"><<for _k range [["out","Ruled out"],["possible","Still possible"]]>><<capture _k>><span @class="$th[_t.id] is _k[0] ? 'opt chosen' : 'opt'"><<link _k[1]>><<set $th[_t.id] to _k[0]>><<replace "#thlist">><<include "TheoryList">><</replace>><<replace "#thgo">><<include "TheoryGo">><</replace>><</link>></span><</capture>><</for>></div></div>
<</capture>><</for>>


:: TheoryGo
<<if Object.keys($th).length lt setup.theories.length>><p class="note">Decide all five theories to go on.</p>
<<else>><div class="actions">[[Open the suspect files|Suspects]]</div><</if>>


:: Suspects [nobar]
<h2>Three suspect files</h2>
<p>Investigators looked at many people. None was ever charged with the theft, so we don't print their names here. For each one, pick the evidence that could actually be checked.</p>
<div id="suslist"><<include "SuspectList">></div>
<div id="susgo"><<include "SuspectGo">></div>


:: SuspectList
<<for _s range setup.suspects>><<capture _s>>
<div class="folder"><p class="folder-tab"><<print _s.name>></p>
<ul><<for _f range _s.facts>><li><<print _f>></li><</for>></ul>
<p class="poster-part">The evidence that could be checked</p>
<div class="choices"><<for _ki, _kv range _s.keys>><<capture _ki, _kv>><span @class="$key[_s.id] === _ki ? 'opt chosen' : 'opt'"><<link _kv[0]>><<set $key[_s.id] to _ki>><<replace "#suslist">><<include "SuspectList">><</replace>><<replace "#susgo">><<include "SuspectGo">><</replace>><</link>></span><</capture>><</for>></div></div>
<</capture>><</for>>


:: SuspectGo
<<if Object.keys($key).length lt setup.suspects.length>><p class="note">Pick the checkable evidence for all three to go on.</p>
<<else>><div class="actions">[[On to my report|Report]]</div><</if>>


